lling"},{"text":"Digital preservation"},{"text":"Climate-risk assessment"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Climate change is also increasing concerns around temperature, humidity, flooding, extreme weather and disaster preparedness for heritage collections."},{"type":"p","text":"The future Conservation Assistant should therefore become comfortable with both:"},{"type":"h","text":"Physical heritage + scientific/digital conservation"}]},{"heading":"Internships","kind":"internships","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Government / Public Sector / Cultural Institutions"},{"type":"table","header":["Organisation / environment","Useful exposure"],"rows":[[{"text":"Archaeological Survey of India (ASI)"},{"text":"Archaeological and built-heritage conservation"}],[{"text":"National Museum"},{"text":"Museum collections and conservation"}],[{"text":"National Gallery of Modern Art"},{"text":"Art collections and preventive conservation"}],[{"text":"State museums"},{"text":"Collection management and preservation"}],[{"text":"State archaeology departments"},{"text":"Archaeological conservation"}],[{"text":"National Archives of India"},{"text":"Paper/document preservation"}],[{"text":"Government museums and archives"},{"text":"Preventive conservation"}],[{"text":"University museums"},{"text":"Collection documentation"}],[{"text":"Cultural heritage institutions"},{"text":"Heritage preservation"}],[{"text":"PM Internship Scheme"},{"text":"General industry exposure where eligible"}]]},{"type":"p","text":"Useful official starting points include Archaeological Survey of India and Ministry of Culture.","url":"https://asi.nic.in/"},{"type":"p","text":"Actual conservation-lab access can be restricted and normally requires institutional approval."},{"type":"h","text":"Private / Industry"},{"type":"p","text":"Target:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Conservation studios"},{"text":"Museum conservation laboratories"},{"text":"Art-restoration studios"},{"text":"Heritage consultancies"},{"text":"Art logistics 