{"type":"p","text":"Conservation Assistant is a plausible entry point, but advanced treatment roles generally require specialised conservation training."},{"type":"p","text":"A student should distinguish between:"},{"type":"h","text":"Preventive/collections support"},{"type":"p","text":"and"},{"type":"p","text":"Professional object treatment/restoration."},{"type":"p","text":"The second pathway usually has substantially higher technical and qualification requirements."}]},{"heading":"Postgraduate Study in India","kind":"pg_india","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["PG pathway","Useful for"],"rows":[[{"text":"MA Museology"},{"text":"Museum collections and management"}],[{"text":"MA Heritage Management"},{"text":"Heritage institutions"}],[{"text":"MA Conservation Studies"},{"text":"Conservation pathway where available"}],[{"text":"PG Diploma in Conservation"},{"text":"Practical conservation specialisation"}],[{"text":"Master's in Conservation of Cultural Heritage"},{"text":"Advanced conservation"}],[{"text":"MA Archaeology"},{"text":"Archaeological heritage"}],[{"text":"MA Art History"},{"text":"Art collections and research"}],[{"text":"MA Heritage Studies"},{"text":"Heritage management"}],[{"text":"MSc Conservation Science"},{"text":"Scientific conservation"}],[{"text":"Master's in Archaeological Conservation"},{"text":"Archaeological objects/sites"}],[{"text":"Digital Heritage/Heritage Technology"},{"text":"Technology pathway"}],[{"text":"PhD Conservation/Heritage"},{"text":"Research and academia"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"Important qualification distinction"},{"type":"p","text":"A student targeting:"},{"type":"h","text":"Museum Collections / Preventive Conservation"},{"type":"p","text":"can build strongly from Museology/Heritage Management."},{"type":"p","text":"A student targeting:"},{"type":"h","text":"Independent Conservation Treatment"},{"type":"p","text":"should consider a specialised conservation degree/diploma and supervised practical training."}]},{"heading":"Study Abroad — Country by Country","kind":"abroad","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Country","Example programme areas to research","Scholarship route","Gate to check"],"rows":[[{"text":"UK"},{"text":"Conservation, museum studies, heritage management"},{"text":"Chevening + university funding"},{"text":"Portfolio + science/programme requirements"}],[{"text":"USA"},{"text":"Conservation, museum studies, cultural heritage"},{"text":"University funding + Fulbright"},{"text":"Programme prerequisites"}],[{"text":"Italy"},{"text":"Conservation/restoration + cultural heritage"},{"text":"University/regional scholarships"},{"text":"Practical/science requirements"}],[{"text":"France"},{"text":"Heritage conservation and museum studies"},{"text":"Campus France + university funding"},{"text":"Language + programme requirements"}],[{"text":"Germany"},{"text":"Conservation science and heritage"},{"text":"DAAD"},{"text":"Programme/language requirements"}],[{"text":"Netherlands"},{"text":"Conservation, museum studies and heritage"},{"text":"University scholarships"},{"text":"Portfolio/programme requirements"}],[{"text":"Australia"},{"text":"Cultural heritage and museum studies"},{"text":"University scholarships"},{"text":"Programme requirements"}]]},{"type":"p","text":"For scholarship research, use USIEF / Fulbright-Nehru and DAAD India.","url":"https://www.usief.org.in/"},{"type":"h","text":"Application portfolio"},{"type":"p","text":"Prepare:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Academic transcripts"},{"text":"CV"},{"text":"Statement of purpose"},{"text":"Museum/heritage projects"},{"text":"Condition-report samples"},{"text":"Preventive-conservation audit"},{"text":"Documentation portfolio"},{"text":"Internship experience"},{"text":"Research paper"},{"text":"Recommendation letters"},{"text":"English-language test where required"},{"text":"Portfolio where required"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Exact programme requirements and deadlines are: check the official site."}]},{"heading":"Going Forward","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Career progression"},{"type":"flow","items":["BA Museology/Heritage Management","Conservation Intern","Conservation Assistant","Senior Conservation Assistant / Conservation Technician","Conservation Specialist","Conservator"]},{"type":"p","text":"Alternative route:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Conservation Assistant","Preventive Conservation Specialist","Collections Manager"]},{"type":"p","text":"Another route:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Conservation Assistant","Heritage Documentation Specialist","Digital Heritage Specialist"]},{"type":"p","text":"Research route:"},{"type":"flow","items":["BA","MA/MSc Conservation","Research Assistant","Conservation Researcher","PhD","Research Scientist/Academic"]},{"type":"h","text":"PhD Routes"},{"type":"p","text":"Potential research areas include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Conservation Science"},{"text":"Museum Studies"},{"text":"Heritage Studies"},{"text":"Archaeological Conservation"},{"text":"Art Conservation"},{"text":"Materials Science"},{"text":"Cultural Heritage Management"},{"text":"Digital Heritage"},{"text":"Heritage Science"},{"text":"Archaeology"},{"text":"Art History"},{"text":"Architecture/Heritage Conservation"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Research topics could include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Climate risk to cultural heritage"},{"text":"Museum environmental monitoring"},{"text":"Digital preservation"},{"text":"AI-assisted deterioration detection"},{"text":"Heritage materials science"},{"text":"Archaeological conservation"},{"text":"Paper deterioration"},{"text":"Textile conservation"},{"text":"Metal corrosion"},{"text":"Stone deterioration"},{"text":"Museum pest management"},{"text":"Disaster-risk reduction"},{"text":"3D documentation"},{"text":"Digital twins for heritage"},{"text":"Preventive conservation"}]},{"type":"note","label":"2035–2046","text":"Long-Term Career Evolution"},{"type":"p","text":"The conservation sector is moving toward evidence-based, preventive and technology-assisted heritage preservation."},{"type":"p","text":"Potential progression:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Conservation Assistant","Conservation Specialist","Conservator","Senior Conservator"]},{"type":"p","text":"Specialist pathways include:"},{"type":"h","text":"Preventive Conservation → Collections Risk Manager"},{"type":"h","text":"Museum Collections → Collections Manager"},{"type":"h","text":"Heritage Documentation → Digital Heritage Specialist"},{"type":"h","text":"Conservation Science → Heritage Scientist"},{"type":"h","text":"Archaeological Conservation → Archaeological Conservator"},{"type":"h","text":"Digital Preservation → Digital Collections Specialist"},{"type":"p","text":"The strongest long-term profile will combine:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Museology","Conservation","Materials Science","Documentation","Preventive Care","Heritage Management","Digital Technology","Scientific Thinking"],"sep":"+"}]}]}